WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.360
Every Record keeps the whole chat it came from, attached at the

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.520
bottom of the Record.

3
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.780
That is every message, photo, voice note and any documents, with the

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.920
time they were sent.

5
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.400
So if anyone ever asks where the data came from, you can show them.
